# RoadGuard guidance index (proposed)

`../AGENTS.md` is the short entrypoint. Rules below route source and evidence; module maps locate code and tests. Product meaning lives in `docs/product/`, wire definitions in `contracts/` only after per-contract adoption, implementation guidance in `docs/backend/`, decisions in `docs/decisions/` and `planning/refactor/02-decision-register.md`, task checkpoints in `planning/refactor/`.

Read `rules/evidence.md` and `rules/delivery.md` for every task, `rules/safety.md` for side effects, `rules/review-and-coordination.md` for self-review and shared work, and only the applicable module map. Existing RoadGuard skills are historical during this refactor program; no replacement skill is proposed. Follow the owner-approved active manifest version once activated.
